## Visão geral

| Item | Valor |
|------|--------|
| Projeto | Super Family Quest (frontend) |
| Stack | React 19, TypeScript strict ~5.8, Vite 6, Chakra UI 2, ESM |
| Estado servidor | TanStack React Query 5 |
| Estado global UI | Context API (`AuthContext`, `ThemeContext`, `CoinFlightContext`) |
| API | Axios + JWT em `localStorage` (`accessToken`) |
| Realtime | `socket.io-client` (ex.: listas de compras) |
| PWA | `vite-plugin-pwa` + `PWAInstallBanner` |
| Deploy | Netlify (`npm run build` → `dist/`) |

